      { en: 'The number of ... rose sharply from ... to ... over the period.', zh: '在此期间，……的数量从……急剧上升到……。' },
      { en: 'It peaked at ... before dropping back to... ', zh: '它在……处达到峰值，随后回落到……。' },
      { en: 'According to the pie chart, ... takes up the largest share, at about 40%.', zh: '饼图显示，……占比最大，约为 40%。' },
